        89.46791076660156
      ],
      "text": "Drug resistance and TPT",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 19.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        94.91883087158203,
        527.4224243164062,
        109.36183166503906
      ],
      "text": "Programme-based surveillance systems and clinical studies should be conducted to monitor the risk",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        108.11884307861328,
        524.3675537109375,
        122.56184387207031
      ],
      "text": "for resistance to the medicines used in TPT. Particular consideration should be given to rifamycin-",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        121.31879425048828,
        527.120849609375,
        135.7617950439453
      ],
      "text": "containing regimens because of the dearth of data. Conversely, the impact on PMTPT of high levels of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.975823402404785,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        134.51893615722656,
        524.0899047851562,
        148.96192932128906
      ],
      "text": "resistance among prevalent TB strains to isoniazid and/or rifamycins should be studied. Programme-",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.995199203491211,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        147.7189483642578,
        527.3904418945312,
        162.1619415283203
      ],
      "text": "based surveillance and specially designed studies should be conducted to monitor the emergence",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        160.91896057128906,
        527.4119262695312,
        175.36195373535156
      ],
      "text": "of clinically relevant resistance in TB bacilli and other bacterial flora to fluoroquinolones and other",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        174.11891174316406,
        253.43289184570312,
        188.5619659423828
      ],
      "text": "TPT. medicines used on a large scale for",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        202.55023193359375,
        438.8079528808594,
        227.34523010253906
      ],
      "text": "Adherence to and completion of treatment",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 19.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        232.7960968017578,
        527.4555053710938,
        247.2390899658203
      ],
      "text": "Carefully designed studies, including RCTs, are required to establish the effectiveness of context-specific",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.952547073364258,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        245.99610900878906,
        527.1119384765625,
        260.4391174316406
      ],
      "text": "interventions to improve adherence and completion of treatment. The studies should include specific",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.988744735717773,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        259.19598388671875,
        527.3992309570312,
        273.6390075683594
      ],
      "text": "risk groups, depending on resources and the health-system infrastructure, and address questions",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        272.3961181640625,
        527.4503173828125,
        286.8391418457031
      ],
      "text": "on integration of TPT into differentiated models of HIV service delivery. Use of digital technology to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        285.59613037109375,
        524.3771362304688,
        300.0391540527344
      ],
      "text": "improve adherence is an important area. Further research is required on the effectiveness of self-",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        298.79608154296875,
        414.2792053222656,
        313.2391662597656
      ],
      "text": "isoniazid. administration of the 3-month regimen of weekly rifapentine plus",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86614990234375,
        320.4999694824219,
        527.4056396484375,
        334.9429931640625
      ],
      "text": "Studies on the effectiveness of context-specific interventions to enhance adherence and completion",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        333.70001220703125,
        527.2554321289062,
        348.1430358886719
      ],
      "text": "of treatment, such as self-administration with and without digital technology to ensure adherence, will",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.98098373413086,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        346.8999938964844,
        527.4332275390625,
        361.343017578125
      ],
      "text": "be helpful. Implementation research on context-specific barriers and facilitators is necessary for TPT",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        360.1000061035156,
        527.3955688476562,
        374.54302978515625
      ],
      "text": "to MDR/RR-TB, to explore dimensions for which the evidence is often sparse, such as acceptability,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        373.3000183105469,
        229.13189697265625,
        387.7430419921875
      ],
      "text": "feasibility, equity and resource use.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        401.731201171875,
        230.23486328125,
        426.5262145996094
      ],
      "text": "Cost–effectiveness",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 19.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        431.9772033691406,
        527.392578125,
        446.42022705078125
      ],
      "text": "Research should be conducted on service delivery models for TPT in order to lower costs, improve",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        445.1772155761719,
        527.39306640625,
        459.6202392578125
      ],
      "text": "equity and optimize the follow-up of people exposed to TB and MDR/RR-TB, whether or not they",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        458.377197265625,
        527.0759887695312,
        472.8202209472656
      ],
      "text": "received fluoroquinolones, in terms of duration, monitoring approaches and frequency of visits. Such",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.995749473571777,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        471.57720947265625,
        527.4520263671875,
        486.0202331542969
      ],
      "text": "evidence could guide optimization of contact-tracing strategies in households and the delivery of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        484.7772216796875,
        527.4406127929688,
        499.2202453613281
      ],
      "text": "public health interventions for common modifiable risks of affected people, such as use of tobacco,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        497.9772033691406,
        155.98130798339844,
        512.4202270507812
      ],
      "text": "alcohol. drugs and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        526.408447265625,
        492.3905334472656,
        551.2034301757812
      ],
      "text": "Preventive treatment for contacts of people with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 19.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        549.2083740234375,
        172.7669219970703,
        574.0033569335938
      ],
      "text": "MDR/RR-TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 19.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        579.4542846679688,
        527.3958740234375,
        593.8972778320312
      ],
      "text": "The strong recommendation for use of TPT for MDR/RR-TB should not be used as a justification for",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        592.6544189453125,
        527.4321899414062,
        607.097412109375
      ],
      "text": "stopping trials or create ethical impediments to such research. RCTs with adequate power are still",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        605.8543090820312,
        527.5223999023438,
        620.2973022460938
      ],
      "text": "necessary to update the recommendation on TPT for contacts of people with MDR/RR-TB. Trials",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        619.0543212890625,
        527.4278564453125,
        633.497314453125
      ],
      "text": "should be performed with both adult and paediatric populations and with at-risk populations such",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        632.2542724609375,
        527.3467407226562,
        646.697265625
      ],
      "text": "as people with HIV. The composition, dosage and duration of TPT regimens for MDR/RR-TB could be",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.993748664855957,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        645.4542846679688,
        527.4365234375,
        659.8972778320312
      ],
      "text": "further optimized, and the potential role of newer agents with good sterilization properties should",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        658.6544189453125,
        527.6586303710938,
        673.097412109375
      ],
      "text": "be investigated. Regimens that remain effective in the presence of fluoroquinolone resistance should",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.998449325561523,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        671.8543090820312,
        527.434326171875,
        686.2973022460938
      ],
      "text": "also be studied. The effectiveness and safety of TPT for contacts of people with MDR/RR-TB should",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        685.0543212890625,
        527.2593994140625,
        699.497314453125
      ],
      "text": "be evaluated under operational conditions. Further evidence on the risk for progression to TB disease",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.98093318939209,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        698.2542724609375,
        503.2532958984375,
        712.697265625
      ],
      "text": "of contacts of people with MDR/RR-TB will be important for understanding the benefits of TPT.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86605834960938,
        719.9581909179688,
        527.4530029296875,
        734.4011840820312
      ],
      "text": "TPT regimens for MDR/RR-TB that are shorter than 6 months and have a good safety profile in",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86605834960938,
        733.1583251953125,
        527.429443359375,
        747.601318359375
      ],
      "text": "childhood, pregnancy and in the presence of co-morbidities or a risk of drug–drug interactions will",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86605834960938,
        746.3582763671875,
        461.59063720703125,
        760.80126953125
      ],
      "text": "be essential. Pregnancy should not be an absolute exclusion criterion in such studies.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        468.2179870605469,
        801.0170288085938,
        554.0402221679688,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "3. Research gaps 35",
